    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d388">

                <pb facs="0771" n="675" xml:id="pg675"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.6363/2083: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Sheffield</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-12-28T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 28,
                                1926—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>377. I concur in conclusions set forth in last paragraph of your 522, December
                    27, 2 p.m. Department has just received a copy of telegram sent last evening to
                    President Calles and Señor Morones by Petroleum Companies in New York,<anchor
                        n="62" xml:id="d388-f1"/> suggesting extension of time. Please keep
                    Department closely informed by telegraph of all developments.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
